Hi Greg, hi listfolk,

This is a bit of a tricky issue. The variance calculation code in the
dsm.var.* functions needs to use the summary output from the detection
function to get include the detection function uncertainty in the
estimate of variance. Without having constructed the detection function
in mrds/Distance, it's quite difficult to get that object working correctly.

If you are able to send me some more details on your situation we can
see if there's a simple solution and then report back to the list.

All the best,
--dave

